  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've added $11.40 in account credit to Mei's account for the missing salmon roll from order 8901. The balance is now $11.40, and it can be used on any future Forkful order.\n\nSorry the salmon roll didn't make it into your order, Ken. Enjoy your next meal from Kaze Sushi!"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, appreciate it. Have a good night."
